## 2️⃣ Pricing & Booking Summary  

| Charge | Amount (USD) | Approx. AUD* | Notes |
|--------|--------------|--------------|-------|
| **Base price (deposit‑type)** | **USD 204.14** | ≈ AUD 300 | Held as a security deposit (covers damage‑excess, theft‑excess, etc.). |
